# the Pluck steps page (ARP x9): a step chosen with a white key, its level and rung; an edit freezes the line
seed 0
wait 3000
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 17
shot plucksteps_free.png
spin K2 3
wait 200
expect par175 1
tapkey w4
wait 100
spin K2 2
spin K1 5
wait 200
tapkey w8
wait 100
spin K2 1
wait 300
shot plucksteps.png
wait 2000
shot plucksteps_play.png
